---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Documentation">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6 prose prose-invert">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Documentation</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400">Everything you need to integrate GetInsightStream.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Quick Start</h2>
        <p>To start sending events, go to your <a href="/dashboard" class="text-red-400">Dashboard</a> to generate an API key. Then, head to the <a href="/install" class="text-red-400">Install Page</a> to grab your tracking snippet.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">API Reference</h2>
        <p>Our API accepts JSON POST requests at <code>https://api.getinsightstream.com/v1/events</code>.</p>
    </div>
</Layout>
